# location-tracking-system

The location tracking system implements multi-layered geographic verification for bail compliance monitoring:

## Verification Workflows

1. Primary Location Check
- Dual-mode verification combining GPS coordinates with photo evidence
- Real-time accuracy radius calculations for compliance boundary enforcement
- Geographic fence validation against authorized zones
- Explicit consent tracking for location access

2. Administrative Monitoring
- Accuracy radius visualization for location uncertainty ranges
- Geographic compliance boundary overlay system
- Time-based location tracking with jurisdiction support
- Last known position monitoring with confidence metrics

## Location Data Processing

1. Geographic Validation
- County-based routing and jurisdiction assignment
- Compliance boundary intersection detection
- Location accuracy threshold enforcement
- Time-stamped position logging

2. Visualization Components
- Real-time position plotting on administrative interfaces
- Accuracy circle rendering for location uncertainty
- Compliant/non-compliant zone highlighting
- Historical path tracking visualization

## Integration Points

Location data flows into:
- Token-based verification workflows
- Photo compliance evidence collection
- SMS notification triggers
- Multi-jurisdiction compliance monitoring

